  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until caramelized and golden brown, about 8 minutes.",
    "Stir in the minced garlic, grated ginger, lemongrass, kaffir lime leaf, and galangal, and cook for 2 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and vegetable broth, bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Add the cubed vegan brie and stir until the cheese is melted and the soup is creamy.",
    "Season the soup with soy sauce, lime juice, and chili flakes, adjusting to taste.",
    "Simmer for an additional 5 minutes to allow flavors to meld.",
    "Remove the pot from heat and stir in the chopped cilantro.",
    "Taste and add more lime juice or chili flakes if desired.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with extra cilantro if preferred."
  ],
